WEBVTT

00:08:26.474 --> 00:08:30.519
something like this during these nine days I was in jail.

00:08:30.519 --> 00:08:33.996
But in my home country, it was a totally different picture.

00:08:33.996 --> 00:08:35.665
It was more like this:

00:08:35.665 --> 00:08:38.697
"Manal al-Sharif faces charges of disturbing public order

00:08:38.697 --> 00:08:42.439
and inciting women to drive."

00:08:42.439 --> 00:08:45.473
I know.

00:08:45.473 --> 00:08:47.522
"Manal al-Sharif withdraws from the campaign."

00:08:47.522 --> 00:08:50.089
Ah, it's okay. This is my favorite.

00:08:50.089 --> 00:08:52.486
"Manal al-Sharif breaks down and confesses:

00:08:52.486 --> 00:08:54.298
'Foreign forces incited me.'"

00:08:54.298 --> 00:08:56.657
(Laughter)

00:08:56.657 --> 00:09:01.854
And it goes on, even trial and flogging me in public.